
### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health/database

### Create a draft draw
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-api-secret: {{$dotenv ADMIN_API_SECRET}}

{
  "drawCode": "TEST-DRAW-001",
  "drawDateText": "Test date - replace with official date",
  "notes": "Development test only. Not an official draw."
}

### List draws
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws
x-admin-api-secret: {{$dotenv ADMIN_API_SECRET}}

### 4. Add a test prize to the draft draw
# Replace TEST-DRAW-001 with the drawCode of your saved test draw.
# First find the draw's actual id in the response to request 3.

POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws/cmvtg291h0000j0u46phbnhbo/prizes
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-api-secret: {{$dotenv ADMIN_API_SECRET}}

{
  "prizeName": "TEST PRIZE",
  "winningNumber": "000-0000000",
  "prizeAmount": "100.00",
  "currency": "ETB",
  "sortOrder": 1
}
### List all saved draws
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws
x-admin-api-secret: {{$dotenv ADMIN_API_SECRET}}


