POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@2124"
}

### 6. Check admin session
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/me

### 7. Admin logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/logout
